    <briefdescription>
<para>Static configuration tables for the Si5332-GM2 Rev D (VCO 2.5 GHz). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Source: ClockBuilder Pro exports (Design ID UNVBB1)<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>docs/si5332/Si5332-GM2-RevD-UNVBB1-27MHz_XTAL-Registers.h</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>docs/si5332/Si5332-GM2-RevD-UNVBB1-100MHz_ClkIn2-Registers.h</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Structure: base table (identical in both exports) + one delta per clock source. The pre-/postamble (register 0x06) is NOT included; it is controlled by the driver (READY / ACTIVE). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
